Bundled audio

`assets/complete.wav`, `assets/soft.wav` and `assets/rise.wav` are synthesised
from sine waves by this project's authors and are released under CC0 1.0
(public domain dedication): use them for anything, no attribution required.

This repository deliberately contains no third-party recordings. Rings you add
yourself live outside the package, under `~/.dsh/completion-chime/sounds/`, and
are your responsibility to license.